      "title": "ByteTrack: Multi-Object Tracking by Associating Every Detection Box",
      "authors": "Zhang et al., 2022",
      "key_contributions": "BYTE association method - two-stage matching with high and low score detections, 80.3 MOTA on MOT17",
      "relevance": "Primary comparison method, core idea of using low-score detections"
    },
    {
      "file": "paper_002.pdf",
      "title": "BoT-SORT: Robust Associations Multi-Pedestrian Tracking",
      "authors": "Aharon et al., 2022",
